Z||000000||rc5star||06-28-2001||01:54 PM||||Heres the deal:<BR>The idiot alarm (light/door alarm) started to ping once and awhile but would stop after one or two pings. Then the door ajar light came on and stayed on. Then the pinging started and would last for 5-10 min. then go off and on at random. I think other warning lights started coming on on the dash as well but I'm not sure which ones.<P>The car has been taken apart for various fixes/upgrades so I have had no reason to worry about this problem. But once it is together this will be a major problem.<P>Any ideas???????????????????<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||ROB MAC||06-28-2001||02:39 PM||||Sounds like a short in one of the push buttons on the door frame. When a door opens the light comes on and the chime goes off if the key is in the ignition.||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||06-28-2001||03:08 PM||||Your chime box may be on the fritz. Ogre details this problem in the Cave.<P>Solution might be as simple as pulling another one from a Fiero or other Pontiac (I believe Pontiac 6000's used the same chime box...probably other cars of the same vintage do too).||||reg||1
